# Test fixtures directory
# Generated test files are created dynamically during tests
# Don't commit large binary files to git

# Ignore all generated test files
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
# Per-run files the specs name after their temp prefix (e.g. the batch spec's "… notes.txt")
E2E Temp *

# Keep this directory in git
!.gitignore
!README.md
# Tiny real H.264/AAC clip (4s 426x240, ~60KB) used to seed E2E videos without ffmpeg
!e2e-sample.mp4
# Tiny vertical H.264/AAC clip (4s 240x426, ~65KB): a Short (release video-format spec)
!e2e-sample-vertical.mp4
# 1280x720 JPEG used as a custom thumbnail
!e2e-thumbnail.jpg
# 40s 160x90 H.264/AAC clip (~120KB) for chapter tests (chapters need >= 10s each)
!e2e-sample-40s.mp4
# 4s VP8 WebM (no audio) for browsers without H.264 (Playwright Chromium) in frame-extraction tests
!e2e-sample.webm
# 4s 360x640 (9:16) VP8 WebM with a centred circle: thumbnails must keep the vertical aspect
!e2e-sample-vertical-9x16.webm
# 1280x720 and 720x1280 PNGs (~12KB each): the home hero spec serves them as every thumbnail
!hero-landscape-1280x720.png
!hero-portrait-720x1280.png
# 90s 160x90 H.264/AAC clip: watch history and resume need a video of at least 75 s (release builders.ts)
!e2e-sample-90s.mp4
# 4s 240x240 (1:1) H.264/AAC clip (~60KB): a square video (embed-frame-sound spec)
!e2e-sample-square.mp4
